# Alternatives for the focused human source/posture decision, not accepted design.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Useful modern settings choices\nPrompt-free ordinary reads" {class: start}
Script: "A · Recommend app-supplied scripting\nPane IDs / names / anchors + reveal"
ScriptCost: "Explicit Automation / signing / setup decision\nReads: already-running authorized target only"
Sidebar: "B · Version-bound sidebar / deep-link adapter\nOS-shipped data, undocumented format"
SidebarCost: "Explicit format / coverage policy decision\nConditional panes + catch-all; no inventory proof"
Fixed: "C · Individually documented destinations\nLogin Items + Full Disk Access examples"
FixedCost: "Explicit useful-category revision\nCannot silently stand in for required catalogue"
Human: "Focused requirements decision\nSource + posture + useful minimum + stopped-app behavior"
Design: "Final design and whole-producer review\nNew selected action; complete effect authority"
Native: "Finite native acceptance stays pending\nModern witnesses + independent dialog / hydration controls"
Start -> Script: "1 · runtime interface candidate"
Script -> ScriptCost: "2 · cost; no permission inferred"
Start -> Sidebar: "1 · file-format alternative"
Sidebar -> SidebarCost: "2 · cost; no supported-format claim"
Start -> Fixed: "1 · narrower alternative"
Fixed -> FixedCost: "2 · cost; requires human revision"
ScriptCost -> Human: "3 · propose"
SidebarCost -> Human: "3 · alternative"
FixedCost -> Human: "3 · alternative"
Human -> Design: "4 · explicit answer first"
Design -> Native: "5 · G / N / V; no experiment here"
